    "**Cmd+O** - Add Images\n**Cmd+Shift+O** - Choose Output Folder\n**Cmd+R** - Compress\n**Cmd+.** - Cancel\n**Space** - Preview Selected Image\n**Delete** - Remove Selected\n**Cmd+Z** - Undo Remove or Clear All\n**Cmd+,** - Settings" : {
