    "**Strip EXIF Metadata** (on by default) removes location and camera details and converts colors to sRGB, the safest choice for the web. Turn it off to keep the metadata and the original color profile (CMYK images are converted to sRGB). Either way, photos are saved upright, so they never appear sideways." : {
